Subject: [PATCH 3/3] test(turning): pin the Facing window door - inverted
 refused, level passes

The #1409 Facing arm of depth_sane (exact `t >= b`) was unpinned: making
it always true left every suite green. Two pins over the MCP door
(add_operation / edit_operation -> heights_gate):

- an inverted window (edit 47 / 48, and create on 46 stock under a 48
  part) refuses with "must cut downward";
- a level window (48 / 48) passes the door, and a top 1e-9 below the
  plane refuses - the arm carries no tolerance.

Refs #1409

